@baseUrl = https://localhost:7053

### Valid ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Printer not working",
  "description": "The office printer shows a paper jam error.",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### Invalid ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "",
  "description": "Missing subject and bad priority",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### Update a ticket
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Unable to log in (updated)",
  "description": "Login page says invalid password, even after reset.",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Update a ticket that doesn't exist
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Test",
  "description": "Test",
  "priority": "Low",
  "status": "Open"
}

### Update with an invalid status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Test",
  "description": "Test",
  "priority": "Low",
  "status": "Done"
}

### All tickets, first page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=login

### Filter and page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Open&priority=High&page=1&pageSize=5

### Status with a space
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=In%20Progress

### Page size too large (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?pageSize=500

### Unknown status (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Waiting


### Sort by priority, highest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=priority&sortDir=desc

### Sort by subject A-Z
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=subject&sortDir=asc

### Invalid sort column (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=description

### Login: correct password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent@supportdesk.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login: wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent@supportdesk.local",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Login: unknown email (expect 401, same as above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@supportdesk.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login: not an email (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent",
  "password": "Password123!"
}




### Login as agent
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent@supportdesk.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Tickets WITHOUT a token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Tickets WITH a token (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tampered token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x